    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Watch out, young lady! There''s a spooky enemy up ahead: the ghost!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: The ghosts will wander around looking for you, and if they see you,
        they'll chase you until you're dead.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Their line of sight is directly in front of them, so try to avoid that
        area.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: If they see you, try to run into a light source to take them out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Remember, you can't defeat them on your own, so just run!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
