--- !u!1001 &1924659207
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 449407054894491032, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Dialogue Trigger (2)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: char1
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8784599758288289809, guid: 788be39e3f712e748aec28d0df05f9a3, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: char2
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 357313892532197023, guid: 5f263dfd62bfa0545be704bdf4a73a40, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: react
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: talker
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: changes.Array.size
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Ugh...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: Is everything okay, young lady?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Hm? Oh, it's fine, I just didn't think I'd be running into ghosts tonight.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: You got a fear of the paranormal?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'No, it''s not that. I''ve never really been scared of that stuff. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: I'm just reminded of something fun that happened a while back.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[6]'
      value: Back when I was 9 years old, the power went out late at night. It was
        very dark, as you could guess.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[7]'
      value: 'We brought out the flashlights, and my dad suddenly had an idea. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[8]'
      value: He grabbed a white blanket and put it over his head, looking like a
        ghost.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[9]'
      value: He would then sneak around the house trying to get the jump on my mom
        and me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[10]'
      value: Mom and I tried our best to spot him, but he was very sneaky, even with
        the two of us having flashlights.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[11]'
      value: It was a very fun night. Seeing the ghosts here reminded me of that.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[12]'
      value: I just wish... things could go back to how they were then. We were all
        so happy...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[13]'
      value: 'I see... That sounds like a very pleasant memory. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[14]'
      value: It is... and if I give up now, things won't ever change. Let's keep
        going!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[15]'
      value: Atta girl!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'changes.Array.data[1]'
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
