      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: changes.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Young lady, it's been a bit since I checked up on you. How are you feeling?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: Definitely better than I was in the beginning, that's for sure.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: I still feel like confronting my father will be a bit of trouble, but
        I am more confident than I am not.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: That's excellent news! We are almost at the end, so just keep it up!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Yes sir!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'changes.Array.data[1]'
